        "text": "Skip navigation menu\n## Assemblymember Rebecca Bauer-Kahan\n# Delivering Results for Our Community.\n## Assemblymember Rebecca Bauer-Kahan\n# Delivering Results for Our Community.\n## Meet Rebecca\nFocused on issues that matter to local families.\nRebecca Bauer-Kahan is a mom, environmental attorney, and State Assemblymember who has a passion for solving problems and making a difference. She has worked tirelessly to tackle the issues that matter to local families, putting political games aside to be a strong advocate for our community.\nLearn more\n###### Rebecca’s Priorities\n### Common Sense Solutions for Local Families\n##### In the State Assembly, Rebecca is fighting for real results on the issues that matter most to our community, working across the aisle and standing up to special interests to get things done.\n#### Keeping Kids Safe Online\n#### Fixing the Insurance Crisis\n#### Investing in Local Schools\n#### Protecting Reproductive Rights\n###### We’re grateful for your donations!\n$10\n$25\n$50\n$100\n$250\nOther\n$10$25$50$100$250Other",
